items.docs:
Bulk add signal sources from a seed configuration

Request body:
{
    "sources": [
        {"repo": "owner/repo", "category": "multi_agent_ai", "description": "..."},
        ...
    ],
    "replace_existing": false  // If true, removes existing sources first
}

Refresh the Gypsum messaging framework context stream.

Optionally pass version_metadata to track training rationale:
{
    "version_metadata": {
        "Headline": {"content_version_id": "uuid", "change_rationale": "Updated per brand guidelines"},
        "Persona: CTO": {"content_version_id": "uuid", "change_rationale": "Refined pain points"}
    },
    "change_source": "training",
    "change_rationale": "Bulk update after training session"
}

Stream pitch deck generation with progress updates.

Returns Server-Sent Events with:
- {"status": "scraping", "message": "..."}
- {"status": "scraped", "pages": [...]}
- {"status": "generating", "message": "..."}
- {"status": "complete", "deck": {...}}

Get the JSON-LD context file.

Use this in your JSON-LD documents:
{"@context": "https://voyant.io/context-graph/context.jsonld", ...}

Add multiple creators at once.

Request body:
{
    "creators": [
        {"channel_id": "UCsBjURrPoezykLs9EqgamOA", "keywords": ["web dev"]},
        {"channel_name": "ThePrimeagen", "keywords": ["rust", "performance"]}
    ]
}

Check all tracked creators for new content.

Request body:
{
    "hours_back": 168,  // Check for content from last week
    "max_videos_per_creator": 5
}
